# Android emulator placement

Whenever you start or restart the Android emulator for this project:

1. Prefer `powershell -File scripts/start-emulator.ps1` (defaults to AVD `Realme_12_Pro_Plus`).
2. If you start the emulator any other way, immediately run:
   `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/center-emulator.ps1 -Retries 24 -DelayMs 500`
3. Do this every time in this repo — the emulator window must end centered on the primary screen.

Do not leave the emulator window in a corner or off-screen after launch.
